   "statement": {
    "desc": [
     "给你一个非负整数数组 `nums`，最初位于第一个下标，数组中每个元素代表在该位置可以跳跃的最大长度。判断你是否能够到达最后一个下标。"
    ],
    "examples": [
     {
      "input": "nums = [2,3,1,1,4]",
      "output": "true"
     },
     {
      "input": "nums = [3,2,1,0,4]",
      "output": "false"
     }
    ],
    "constraints": [
     "1 <= nums.length <= 10⁴",
     "0 <= nums[i] <= 10⁵"
    ]
   },
   "solution": {
    "idea": [
     "维护「最远可达下标 `reach`」：从左往右扫，只要 `i ≤ reach` 就说明当前格可达，用 `i + nums[i]` 扩展 reach。",
     "一旦 `i > reach`：出现不可达的空档，直接返回 false；能扫完则 true。",
     "贪心正确性：可达性是一个前缀区间 [0, reach]，每一步只是尽力扩张右端点。"
    ],
    "steps": [
     "`reach = 0`",
     "遍历 i：若 `i > reach` → false",
     "否则 `reach = max(reach, i + nums[i])`",
     "`reach >= n-1` → true"
    ],
    "complexity": {
     "time": "O(n)",
     "space": "O(1)"
    },
    "code": "class Solution:\n    def canJump(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:\n        reach = 0\n        for i, x in enumerate(nums):\n            if i > reach:                # 空档：i 不可达\n                return False\n            reach = max(reach, i + x)    # 扩张可达区间\n            if reach >= len(nums) - 1:\n                return True\n        return True"
   },
